/* In ink, as the default style is: every color here is the default style's own.
 * The only change compared to the default style is:
 * RouteRuler-opacity: 0.8;
 *
 * However overriding doesn't work for the colors{} section,
 * so for now we have to keep full version with duplication.
 *
 * TODO: enable overriding ability and keep only changes here
 */

